            <title>[MAHOUT-1787] compute-classpath scripts are not being packaged in the binary distribution</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-1787</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The new compute-classpath.sh  mahout-load-spark-env.sh  and  mahout-spark-class.sh scripts are not being packaged in the /bin directory of the binary distribution of Mahout 0.11.1.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
